## T-002 — Sidebar va header'ni Darken uslubiga moslashtirish

**Holat:** ACCEPTED

**Tekshiruv (Claude Code):**
- `git diff` orqali tasdiqlandi — faqat `sidebar.css` va `header.css`
  o'zgargan, HTML/TS fayllarga tegilmagan.
- Barcha hardcoded hex ranglar (`#6366f1`, `#8b5cf6`, `#ef4444` va h.k.)
  tegishli tokenlarga (`var(--color-primary)`, `var(--color-danger)`)
  almashtirilgan.
- `.nav-link.active` chapdan aksent chiziq (`border-left-color:
  var(--color-primary)`) + fon highlight bilan ta'minlangan.
- `.nav-category` shrift/letter-spacing yangilangan, token orqali.
- `find ... -newer` orqali stray/yangi fayl yaratilmaganligi tasdiqlandi.
- `npm run build` xatosiz o'tdi.

**Izoh:** Oldingi aktiv-band uslubi (yorqin binafsha gradient fon, oq
matn) endi bosilgan/muloyimroq uslubga (fon highlight + chapdan chiziq)
almashtirildi — bu T-002 talabiga mos (dizayn qarori, xato emas).

**Sana:** 2026-07-26
